diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b9d721e..e5a7862 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1 +1,30 @@
 # tpl — Mustache-style templates from the command line
+
+Renders Mustache-style templates (variables, sections, inverted sections, partials,
+comments, custom delimiters) with data from a JSON file. Lua 5.5, standard library only.
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+bin/tpl [-d data.json] [-p partials/] [-o out.html] [--max-depth N] TEMPLATE
+```
+
+`TEMPLATE` or `-d` may be `-` to read standard input. Partials `{{> name}}` are read
+from `DIR/name.mustache`.
+
+Exit codes: 0 ok, 2 usage error, 3 template error, 4 bad data file, 5 file I/O error.
+
+## Layout
+
+- `bin/tpl` — executable wrapper
+- `tpl/json.lua` — JSON decoder
+- `tpl/parser.lua` — tokenizer, standalone lines, section tree
+- `tpl/context.lua` — name lookup, truthiness, value formatting
+- `tpl/render.lua` — renderer and partial loading
+- `tpl/cli.lua` — options, I/O, exit codes
+
+## Tests
+
+```
+lua tests/run.lua
+```
